{"html":"<div class=\"app\"><div class=\"doc-layout\"><nav class=\"sidebar\"><a href=\"/\" class=\"sidebar-wordmark\"><img class=\"sidebar-mark\" alt=\"\" src=\"/loon-bird.svg\"><span>loon</span></a><div class=\"sidebar-section\"><p class=\"sidebar-section-label\">Learn</p><div><a href=\"/tour\" class=\"sidebar-link\">Tour</a><a class=\"sidebar-link sidebar-link-active\" href=\"/install\">Installation</a><a href=\"/examples\" class=\"sidebar-link\">By Example</a></div></div><div class=\"sidebar-section\"><p class=\"sidebar-section-label\">Guide</p><div><a class=\"sidebar-link\" href=\"/guide/basics\">Basics</a><a href=\"/guide/functions\" class=\"sidebar-link\">Functions</a><a href=\"/guide/types\" class=\"sidebar-link\">Types</a><a href=\"/guide/collections\" class=\"sidebar-link\">Collections</a><a class=\"sidebar-link\" href=\"/guide/pattern-matching\">Pattern Matching</a><a class=\"sidebar-link\" href=\"/guide/ownership\">Ownership</a><a href=\"/guide/effects\" class=\"sidebar-link\">Effects</a><a class=\"sidebar-link\" href=\"/guide/modules\">Modules</a><a class=\"sidebar-link\" href=\"/guide/macros\">Macros</a><a href=\"/guide/testing\" class=\"sidebar-link\">Testing</a><a class=\"sidebar-link\" href=\"/guide/errors\">Error Handling</a></div></div><div class=\"sidebar-section\"><p class=\"sidebar-section-label\">Reference</p><div><a class=\"sidebar-link\" href=\"/ref/syntax\">Syntax</a><a href=\"/ref/builtins\" class=\"sidebar-link\">Builtins</a><a class=\"sidebar-link\" href=\"/ref/cli\">CLI</a><a class=\"sidebar-link\" href=\"/ref/effects\">Standard Effects</a><a class=\"sidebar-link\" href=\"/ref/lsp\">LSP</a><a class=\"sidebar-link\" href=\"/ref/formatter\">Formatter</a></div></div><div class=\"sidebar-section\"><p class=\"sidebar-section-label\">Concepts</p><div><a href=\"/concepts/invisible-types\" class=\"sidebar-link\">Why Invisible Types</a><a href=\"/concepts/effects\" class=\"sidebar-link\">Understanding Effects</a><a href=\"/concepts/ownership\" class=\"sidebar-link\">Ownership Mental Model</a><a class=\"sidebar-link\" href=\"/concepts/from-rust\">Coming from Rust</a><a href=\"/concepts/from-js\" class=\"sidebar-link\">Coming from JS/TS</a><a class=\"sidebar-link\" href=\"/concepts/from-clojure\">Coming from Clojure</a></div></div><div class=\"sidebar-section\"><p class=\"sidebar-section-label\">Playground</p><div><a href=\"/play\" class=\"sidebar-link\">Playground</a></div></div><div class=\"sidebar-section\"><p class=\"sidebar-section-label\">Project</p><div><a class=\"sidebar-link\" href=\"/changelog\">Changelog</a><a href=\"/roadmap\" class=\"sidebar-link\">Roadmap</a><a target=\"_blank\" href=\"https://github.com/ecto/loon\" class=\"sidebar-link\">GitHub</a></div></div></nav><div class=\"doc-content\"><div class=\"page doc-shell\"><main class=\"doc-main\"><h1 class=\"doc-h1\">Installation</h1><p class=\"doc-subtitle\">Get Loon running on your machine in under a minute.</p><div><section class=\"doc-section\" id=\"install-loon\"><h2 class=\"doc-h2\">Install Loon</h2><div><p class=\"doc-text\"><div>Run the install script to download the latest release for your platform.</div></p><div class=\"code-block-wrapper\"><div class=\"code-block-label\">SHELL</div><pre class=\"code-block\"><code class=\"language-loon\">curl -fsSL https://loonlang.com/install.sh | sh</code></pre></div><div class=\"doc-note doc-note-info\"><p class=\"doc-note-label\">Note</p><p class=\"doc-note-text\">Supports macOS (ARM and Intel) and Linux (x86_64). Windows support is coming via WSL.</p></div></div></section><section id=\"verify-installation\" class=\"doc-section\"><h2 class=\"doc-h2\">Verify Installation</h2><div><p class=\"doc-text\"><div>Confirm Loon is installed and on your PATH.</div></p><div class=\"code-block-wrapper\"><div class=\"code-block-label\">SHELL</div><pre class=\"code-block\"><code class=\"language-loon\">$ loon --version\nloon <span class=\"syntax-number\">0.1.0</span></code></pre></div><p class=\"doc-text\"><div>If the command is not found, you may need to add <span class=\"ic\">~/.loon/bin</span> to your PATH.</div></p><div class=\"code-block-wrapper\"><div class=\"code-block-label\">SHELL</div><pre class=\"code-block\"><code class=\"language-loon\">export <span class=\"syntax-function\">PATH=</span><span class=\"syntax-string\">\"$HOME/.loon/bin:$PATH\"</span></code></pre></div></div></section><section class=\"doc-section\" id=\"editor-setup\"><h2 class=\"doc-h2\">Editor Setup</h2><div><div class=\"doc-subsection\"><h3 class=\"doc-h3\">VS Code</h3><div><p class=\"doc-text\"><div>Install the Loon extension from the VS Code marketplace.</div></p><div class=\"code-block-wrapper\"><div class=\"code-block-label\">SHELL</div><pre class=\"code-block\"><code class=\"language-loon\">code --install-extension loon-lang.loon-vscode</code></pre></div><p class=\"doc-text\"><div>The extension provides syntax highlighting, diagnostics, hover types, go-to-definition, and completions.</div></p></div></div><div class=\"doc-subsection\"><h3 class=\"doc-h3\">Other Editors</h3><div><p class=\"doc-text\"><div>Loon ships with a built-in language server. Point your editor's LSP client at the <span class=\"ic\">loon lsp</span> command.</div></p><div class=\"code-block-wrapper\"><div class=\"code-block-label\">SHELL</div><pre class=\"code-block\"><code class=\"language-loon\">loon lsp</code></pre></div><div class=\"doc-note doc-note-tip\"><p class=\"doc-note-label\">Tip</p><p class=\"doc-note-text\">For Neovim, add a lspconfig entry with cmd = { \"loon\", \"lsp\" } and filetypes = { \"loon\" }.</p></div></div></div></div></section><section id=\"your-first-program\" class=\"doc-section\"><h2 class=\"doc-h2\">Your First Program</h2><div><p class=\"doc-text\"><div>Create a file called <span class=\"ic\">hello.loon</span> with the following contents.</div></p><div class=\"code-block-wrapper\"><div class=\"code-block-label\">hello.loon</div><pre class=\"code-block\"><code class=\"language-loon\"><span class=\"syntax-paren\">[</span><span class=\"syntax-keyword\">fn</span> main <span class=\"syntax-paren\">[</span><span class=\"syntax-paren\">]</span>\n  <span class=\"syntax-paren\">[</span><span class=\"syntax-builtin\">println</span> <span class=\"syntax-string\">\"Hello, world!\"</span><span class=\"syntax-paren\">]</span><span class=\"syntax-paren\">]</span>\n\n<span class=\"syntax-paren\">[</span>main<span class=\"syntax-paren\">]</span></code></pre></div><p class=\"doc-text\"><div>Run it with the <span class=\"ic\">loon run</span> command.</div></p><div class=\"code-block-wrapper\"><div class=\"code-block-label\">SHELL</div><pre class=\"code-block\"><code class=\"language-loon\">$ loon run hello.loon\n<span class=\"syntax-function\">Hello,</span> world!</code></pre></div><div class=\"doc-note doc-note-tip\"><p class=\"doc-note-label\">Tip</p><p class=\"doc-note-text\">Use loon run --watch to re-run automatically when the file changes.</p></div></div></section><section id=\"what-s-next\" class=\"doc-section\"><h2 class=\"doc-h2\">What's Next</h2><div><p class=\"doc-text\"><div>You're all set. Head to By Example for a cookbook of short programs, or jump into the language guide to learn the fundamentals.</div></p><ul class=\"doc-list\"><div><li class=\"doc-list-item\"><span><a href=\"/examples\">By Example</a> — complete annotated programs</span></li><li class=\"doc-list-item\"><span><a href=\"/guide/basics\">Language Guide</a> — learn the fundamentals</span></li><li class=\"doc-list-item\"><span><a href=\"/play\">Playground</a> — try Loon in the browser</span></li></div></ul></div></section><div class=\"doc-nav\"><a href=\"/tour\" class=\"doc-nav-link doc-nav-prev\">← Tour</a><a class=\"doc-edit\" href=\"https://github.com/ecto/loon/edit/main/web/src/pages/install.loon\" target=\"_blank\">Edit this page</a><a href=\"/examples\" class=\"doc-nav-link doc-nav-next\">By Example →</a></div></div></main><nav class=\"doc-toc\"><p class=\"doc-toc-label\">On this page</p><div><a class=\"doc-toc-link\" href=\"#install-loon\">Install Loon</a><a class=\"doc-toc-link\" href=\"#verify-installation\">Verify Installation</a><a class=\"doc-toc-link\" href=\"#editor-setup\">Editor Setup</a><a href=\"#your-first-program\" class=\"doc-toc-link\">Your First Program</a><a class=\"doc-toc-link\" href=\"#what-s-next\">What's Next</a></div></nav></div><footer class=\"footer\" style=\"align-items: center; padding: 3rem 0; display: flex; gap: 1.5rem; margin-top: 2rem\"><span style=\"color: var(--muted); letter-spacing: 0.1em; font-family: 'IBM Plex Mono', ui-monospace, 'SFMono-Regular', monospace; font-size: 0.78rem\">loon</span><a href=\"https://github.com/ecto/loon\" target=\"_blank\" style=\"font-family: 'IBM Plex Mono', ui-monospace, 'SFMono-Regular', monospace; text-decoration: none; font-size: 0.78rem; color: var(--muted); letter-spacing: 0.05em\">GitHub</a><a target=\"_blank\" href=\"https://github.com/ecto/loon/blob/main/LICENSE\" style=\"font-family: 'IBM Plex Mono', ui-monospace, 'SFMono-Regular', monospace; text-decoration: none; font-size: 0.78rem; color: var(--muted); letter-spacing: 0.05em\">MIT License</a></footer></div></div></div>","title":null}
